# Declares that this repo deploys as part of /sprint-ship (Phase 7).
# One skill name per line; sprint-ship invokes each in order after the merge
# and local cleanup, so what ships is what is running.
#
# Absent file = phase skipped silently. That matters here more than most:
# kvllm.service sets WorkingDirectory to this checkout and execs
# `python -m kvllm.registry serve`, so the running server keeps executing
# whatever code it loaded at start. Nothing else in the workflow restarts it,
# so without this phase a sprint can change the serve path and land on main
# while the box goes on serving the previous sprint's argv indefinitely.
#
# The skill no-ops unless serve-path inputs actually changed, and refuses
# outright while an eval is orchestrating the service.
#
# See .claude/skills/deploy-kvllm/SKILL.md
deploy-kvllm
